```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"提示词\n\n现在请你切换成交付负责人，不再新增功能，只做最后收口。\n请把当前结果整理成一套别接得住的交付材料，至少包括：1，README：怎么启动、怎么跑、怎么验证 2．设计说明：为什么这么设计，核心结构是什么3．测试说明：验证了什么，还有什么没验证\n4，风险与限制：哪些问题是已知的，为什么当前仍可接受\n5.演示顺序：如果只有分钟，应该按什么顺序展示\n要求：\n- 不要重新编故事\n- 文档必须和真实实现一致用最短路径让别人看懂\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-2av6egh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-2av6egh","updated":"20260510171022"}},{"ID":"20260510171022-uss5m9a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-uss5m9a","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"电影评分与AI搜索网站开发过程"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-bxgbpbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-bxgbpbx","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的 VibeCoding 开发流程围绕电影评分网站项目展开"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-p0k16c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-p0k16c5","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遵循 Superpowers 全流程规范，整体呈现结构化、分阶段推进的特点"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心分为五大核心阶段且环环相扣"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-l66orqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-l66orqa","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先是需求澄清阶段"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以用户提供的原始需求提示词为输入"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 深度分析需求后生成包含项目概述、功能模块、数据库设计、API 设计、爬虫设计"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等在内的结构化设计文档"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"明确了前端 React+Vite、后端 Python+FastAPI、数据库 SQLite 的技术栈"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以及用户认证、电影评分、爬虫兜底等核心功能的设计方向，为后续开发奠定了清晰的规格基础"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-dfjnkax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-dfjnkax","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着进入开发计划阶段"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在设计文档确认通过后，将开发工作拆分为前端、后端各 9 个 Task 并写入独立计划文件"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"严格遵循 “所有计划完成后再启动开发” 的规范，确保开发过程有明确的任务指引"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-g91x7yk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-g91x7yk","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后是子代理驱动开发阶段"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用Task工具派遣子智能体"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一个干前端，一个干后端，并行"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个 Task 都拆解为具体步骤、代码示例和测试方法，保障开发按计划落地"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-fk31jkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-fk31jkg","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"测试驱动开发阶段本需严格遵循 RED-GREEN-REFACTOR 循环"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但受时间限制，仅完成了基础功能测试"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未完全达成测试覆盖率要求（简单任务≥85%、中等≥91%、复杂≥94%）"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代码审查阶段则通过实际运行和测试"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"完成了规格合规性与代码质量两阶段审查，验证核心功能的有效性"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-e8gf7qd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-e8gf7qd","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在整个开发过程中，还针对实际遇到的问题逐一解决，"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（如 JWT 字段类型不匹配、bcrypt 版本兼容、前端渲染崩溃、电影图片加载失败等）"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如更换 TMDb 图片源、配置 CORS、调整数据排序逻辑等"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最终形成了包含前后端完整目录结构、24 部电影数据、核心 API 接口的可运行项目"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-7tprhu7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-7tprhu7","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"记录对话"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-8u3ywzx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-8u3ywzx","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最近上映电影还是不对，为什么最新的才是2016年？，如果豆瓣爬不出可以试试爬猫眼"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-tbzels4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-tbzels4","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：电影数据过旧，尝试猫眼爬取"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-xm5z19t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-xm5z19t","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"添加了 get_maoyan_coming_soon () 方法 - 获取即将上映的电影"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用猫眼移动端 API https://m.maoyan.com/ajax/movieOnInfoList 获取数据"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"添加 API 端点 (movies.py)"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"/api/movies/now-playing - 返回正在上映的电影列表"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"/api/movies/coming-soon - 返回即将上映的电影列表"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新前端 API (movies.js)"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"添加了 getNowPlaying () 和 getComingSoon () 方法"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更新首页 (Home.jsx)"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"添加了 \"正在上映\" 和 \"即将上映\" 两个标签页"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自动从猫眼获取最新电影数据"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-d9moo02","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-d9moo02","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在一次能加载出来十二部影片，我想你添加一个按钮在页面最底部中间，用来获取更多影片"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-4rc18wc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-4rc18wc","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.四个问题："},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.点击加载更多后的影片有的没图片"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.即将上映板块没内容了"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.正在上映板块需要按上映时间排序，目前不是"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.我需要你标注每个影片是来自豆瓣的还是猫眼的"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：已完成所有4个问题的修复！"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-jc5tegu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-jc5tegu","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一阶段扩展开发"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-up680za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-up680za","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一阶段目标不是实现 AI 推荐，而是把当前“电影评分网站”升级为一个结构完整、可扩展、可继续演进的电影产品底座，为第二阶段的自然语言搜索、向量检索和推荐解释能力提供稳定基础。"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-afi9qqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-afi9qqz","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一阶段完成后，系统应具备以下特征："}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-yqprdf9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-yqprdf9","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260510171022-fvponpx","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-fvponpx","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260510171022-nu29pou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-nu29pou","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用户系统完整可用"}]}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-vpn0z4h","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Mark