ingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-79eqs5b","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"#### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"修改AI接口工作"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-hpql3hp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-hpql3hp","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"我想修改成让AI接口直接分析出几部影片，然后我这个网页负责加载出来"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-5ffj2fk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-5ffj2fk","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 直接分析出几部影片返回 片名 + 年份/导演，网页按更精确条件匹配加载"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当 AI 推荐的片子在你本地库里找不到时，自动去远程源补抓再展示"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-na3s78d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-na3s78d","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"AI 返回片名 + 年份/导演"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：足够精确，能复用你现在本地库、补抓、详情页、卡片展示；改动范围也可控。"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：需要加一层“匹配/补抓”逻辑，但复杂度合理。"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是我推荐的方案。"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-kio7r88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-kio7r88","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用这个方案写一个简洁实现设计文档"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-099yx48","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-099yx48","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"实施"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-8f5b95l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-8f5b95l","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"已实施成“AI 先选片，网站再匹配/补抓展示”的主链路。"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-9azmxxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-9azmxxa","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这次的核心改动在 backend/app/routers/ai.py (line 1) 和 backend/app/services/ai_curated_search.py (line 1)。/api/ai/search 现在会先调用 AI 生成 title + year + director + reason 片单，再按 title + year、title + director 去本地库匹配；本地找不到时会走现有远程搜索并通过 MovieSyncService 入库。返回给前端的仍然是站内 movie + reason，所以详情页和卡片展示链路可以继续复用。"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-h4zrquj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-h4zrquj","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前端 frontend/src/pages/Search.jsx (line 1) 也已同步到新状态模型，AI 模式下不再展示旧的“向量召回/本地回退”语义，而是展示 ai_curated / ai_curated_remote_backfill / ai_curated_unavailable。另外我补了 prompt 和一组新回归测试草稿： backend/app/prompts/curated_movie_search.txt (line 1)、backend/tests/test_ai_curated_search.py (line 1)"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-2gi7c1m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-2gi7c1m","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"##### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"AI接口的提示词文档"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-xsbbfqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-xsbbfqe","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你是电影选片助手。你的任务不是泛泛推荐高分电影，而是严格根据用户描述挑出最符合条件的具体影片。"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-gidfw11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-gidfw11","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"请只返回 JSON 数组，不要输出任何解释、标题、代码块标记或 markdown。"}]},{"ID":"20260510171022-paucjxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260510171022-paucjxl","updated":"20260510171022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出格式："},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"{"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"title\": \"电影名\","},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\"year\